/tmp/tmp.e6ZuziTSpx/NGpowerdomination_nolinenumbers.tex:522:The tight upper bound in Theorem \ref{NGsumthmcon} for $\pd(G)+\pd(\Gc)$  with both $G$ and $\Gc$ connected  was obtained by switching from floor to ceiling.  This raises a question about the bound with floor, which has implications for products (see Section \ref{sNGprod}).
